BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Southern Style Thanksgiving
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTSTAMP:20261106T174854Z
UID:3b5c672414ad9b4989c3abdc0911@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Forget the dry obligatory bird. Chef Bill Cosgrove takes Thank
 sgiving down South — a hands-on deep dive into a holiday menu with soul
 \, including cornbread and oyster-stuffed turkey roulade. Roll up your sle
